    <statement><p>Suppose <m>\vec{F} = \left\lt -2y,2x\right&gt;</m>.  Complete the following table of values of <m>\vec{F}</m>.</p>
<p>Values of <m>\vec{F}</m></p>
<tabular bottom="none" left="none" right="none" top="none">
<row halign="left" valign="middle">
<cell><m>y=1</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_1"/></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_2"/></cell>
</row>
<row halign="left" valign="middle">
<cell><m>y=0</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_3"/></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_4"/></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_5"/></cell>
</row>
<row halign="left" valign="middle">
<cell><m>y=-1</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_6"/></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_7"/></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="10" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_8"/></cell>
</row>
<row halign="center" valign="middle">
<cell> </cell>
<cell><m>x=-1</m></cell>
<cell><m>x=0</m></cell>
<cell><m>x=1</m></cell>
</row>
</tabular>
<p>Using your table of values as a starting point, sketch this vector field on a piece of paper for <m>-2 \leq x \leq 2</m> and <m>-2 \leq y \leq 2</m>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\begin{array}{rrr} \left&lt;-2,-2\right&gt; &amp; \left&lt;-2,0\right&gt; &amp; \left&lt;-2,2\right&gt; \\ \left&lt;0,-2\right&gt; &amp; \left&lt;0,0\right&gt; &amp; \left&lt;0,2\right&gt; \\ \left&lt;2,-2\right&gt; &amp; \left&lt;2,0\right&gt; &amp; \left&lt;2,2\right&gt; \end{array}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
